MODIFICATIONS, per section 3(b) of the Agreement

The files here are NOT the upstream files. Each was changed, as follows.

  * `qwenimage21_*.json` are graph exports: the transformer, text encoder and
    VAE decoder traced out of the Diffusers implementation by
    `tools/export_qwenimage21.py` into JuliaVision's own operator format.
    They describe the upstream model's structure and carry no weights.

  * `*_constants.safetensors` hold tensors the export lifted out of the
    traced graph -- the rotary position tables, the output selection mask and
    the timestep frequency table. They are computed from the upstream
    configuration, at the one latent resolution and prompt length the graph
    was exported for.

  * `vae.safetensors` is the upstream VAE decoder converted to half precision
    and renamed to the exported graph's buffer names.

  * `weights-<i>of<n>.safetensors` are Comfy-Org's quantized checkpoints --
    themselves a modification of Qwen's released weights -- split into pieces
    that fit a release asset. The split is byte-for-byte: concatenating the
    tensors of all `n` pieces reproduces Comfy-Org's file exactly, and no
    value was altered. Comfy-Org's own quantization (tensor-wise INT8 with
    ConvRot for the denoiser, asymmetric W4A8 for the encoder) is a change to
    the upstream weights and is described at the compact checkpoint's page.

  * `processor/` is Qwen's tokenizer and chat template, copied unchanged.


